  <model metaid="meta_chlorzoxazone_intestine" id="chlorzoxazone_intestine" name="Model for chlorzoxazone absorption in the small intestine" substanceUnits="mmole" timeUnits="min" volumeUnits="litre" areaUnits="m2" lengthUnits="metre" extentUnits="mmole">
    <notes>
      <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <h1>Model for chlorzoxazone absorption in the small intestine</h1>
        <p>Absorption of chlorzoxazone from the intestinal lumen into the portal
plasma and absorption of oral ethanol. Chlorzoxazone is not metabolized in
the intestine: CYP2E1 is low in the enterocytes, the first pass is the
saturable hepatic CYP2E1.</p>
        <p>The content of this model has been carefully created in a manual research effort.</p>
